      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "VICTA SPENCER (4) was popular in betting last start but disappointed when 6 lengths away in eighth (31.21). Finished second the start before. Has ability and looks hard to stop. ZIPPING WICHITA (3) goes very well here starting six times for two wins and three minors. Was out of placings last time (26.18) at Murray Bridge in a Grade 5, finishing fourth and beaten 4.5 lengths. Looks one of the chances. ZIPPING BOTHAM (8) missed the hat-trick last start when second and beaten 1.5 lengths (22.66) last time at Murray Bridge. Solid record here winning two races. Didn't win last time but still ran one of the quickest times on the card. Expected to feature again. RITZA WOTTON (6) form at this distance reads well.",
